# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# THIRD-PARTY SOURCE. NOT OURS TO REDISTRIBUTE.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 151 MB of other people's repositories, extracted here so the port sites can
# cite exact file and line numbers. Every reference in the code is by path, so
# a reader fetches these themselves - republishing them inside this repo would
# be redistributing someone else's work.
#
#   AvionicsSystems-master   MOARdV's Avionics Systems (MAS)
#   dragon2-ui-*             Neel Dandiwala, SpaceX-Dragon2-UI
#   dashboard-ui-figma       Figma exports of the reference UI
assets/reference/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# BUILD ARTEFACTS
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 54 MB, all regenerated by `python plugin/build.py`. Preview PNGs are output,
# not input - they are how the pages are checked, and they change every build.
plugin/build/preview/
plugin/build/tmp/
plugin/build/refart/
plugin/build/*.exe
plugin/build/*.pdf

# Rewritten by build.py on every invocation (whichever compile ran last) -
# carries no information worth versioning, and churns the working tree.
plugin/build/csc.rsp

# The compiled mod. `build.py install` produces it; committing it means the
# binary and the source can silently disagree about which is current.
plugin/GameData/DragonScreen/DragonScreen.dll
*.dll
*.pdb
*.mdb

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# FLIGHT DATA
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Recorder output. Attach a specific CSV to an issue when it is evidence;
# do not carry every test flight in the history.
*.csv
DragonScreen_capture/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# LOCAL
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.vs/
obj/
bin/
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.user

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# THIRD-PARTY ART THAT IS NOT USED
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# kenney_ui_scifi: 1117 files, downloaded as a candidate for the chrome and then
# not used - nothing in plugin/ references it. See docs and ASSET_PROVENANCE.md.
assets/kenney_ui_scifi/
# figma: exports of the REFERENCE UI's design, not ours to republish. The layout
# they were used for is captured in docs/UI_AUDIT.md, which IS ours.
assets/figma/

# assets/d-din is kept deliberately: the screens genuinely resolve the D-DIN
# font, it is CC-BY-SA-4.0, and its licence files travel with it.
